Posted: N55° 45.607 W118° 43.358

GPSr: N55° 45.607 W118° 43.359&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A rodeo was going on making the tiny town quite busy.  We were able to park by the cap and get all the traffic to slow down thinking we were a police radar trap.  We had created a small line of traffic with our brief stop.  Thanks for the cap OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

